"Simplified action grammar landed (commit 0421310): move = one empty INTERRUPTIBLE round then Move; quick_move/bop/scratch/divine_heal single-round; boppity_bop = heavy with interruptible preparation + double hit; slime_spray = committed heavy (telegraph, strike, recovery). ActionRound gained its first property, interruptible: while the ACTIVE round is interruptible, queuing a new action cancels the active one immediately (shift_queued_action_system); 'optional action stat block' recorded as the next planned round property. Empty rounds are rendered visibly: actionPhaseOf domain rule (acting/preparing/recovering) + useActionPhase over the subscribed action_rounds table + 'preparing…/recovering…' beside entity names. Full gate green (cargo, clippy, check, 106 unit, e2e 0-6)."